    core: attach the completed Container recipe's inputs at publication
    
    Select the operational Lazy recipe when present, otherwise the live
    completedRecipe, under the operation mutex. Release the mutex before
    attaching exactly one recipe's dependencies and retain Owned: false.
    
    The omission predates both batches in foundation commit c3491f00ad and
    was exposed by batch 2's boot validator. Retained completed recipes must
    keep their direct inputs under batch 1 section 10 and batch 2 section 5.1.
    
    Add a regression that completes a Container before publication and checks
    that its saved producer's parent becomes an explicit direct dependency.
    The existing shutdown persistence test and Container encoder are unchanged.
    
    Signed-off-by: Erik Sipsma <erik@sipsma.dev>

